.TH CONN 1 "September 2026" "conn 0.7" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
conn \- every project and its processes, on one console
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B conn
.br
.B conn ls
.br
.B conn restart
.br
.B conn \-h | \-\-help | \-\-version
.SH DESCRIPTION
A console in the terminal. It puts each open project's shells, dev servers and
agents on the board, and flags the ones holding for input. macOS and Linux.
Processes stay on station when the console is closed.
.SH GENERAL
.TP
